          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ghandiikira malaika w'Ekikunsu eky'Abaikiriza mu Kurisito eky'e Thuyatira, oti: Omwana wa Katonda ali n'amaiso agaaka ng'oti muliro, era ali n'ebigere ebiri ng'oti kyuma kya kikomo ekizigule, akoba ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndidhi by'okola. Ndidhi okugonza n'okwikiriza by'oli nabyo. Ndidhi okugheereza kwo n'okuguminkiriza mu bizibu kw'oli nakwo. Era ndidhi ng'oli kukola ebintu kamaala buti okusinga bye wakolanga mu mainhama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye kye ntasiima ni kino: Oleka omukazi Yezebeli, eyeeyeta omulanzi, yaayegeresa era yaakiidhamya abagheereza bange. Baakola eby'obudankaanu era baalya ebigheereibwayo eri ebisinzibwa ebitali Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.16.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bakyab 16:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.9.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bakyab 9:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.9.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namugha ekiseera okwenenia aye yaloba okuleka obudankaanu bwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ndidha kumukuba ku ndiri n'abo abaayendanga naye badaagedaage, bwe banaaloba okwenenia ebyo bye baakolanga naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era abaana be ndibaita, Ebikunsu eby'Abaikiriza mu Kurisito byonabyona bimanhe nga ninze aidhi kiisi muntu by'alowooza mule ni by'ayenda okukola. Era kiisi mulala ku imwe ndimugha ekigwaniire ebikolwa bye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
